      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Ecosystem testing",
      "source_hash": 17063819952683810810,
      "context_hash": 10012762084925420214,
      "translation": "생태계 테스트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust tests integration with real-world code in the ecosystem to catch regressions and make informed decisions about the evolution of the language.",
      "source_hash": 8592725900800500454,
      "context_hash": 9647297770352096557,
      "translation": "Rust는 회귀를 잡아내고 언어의 발전에 대한 정보에 기반한 결정을 내리기 위해 생태계 내 실제 코드와의 통합을 테스트합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Testing methods",
      "source_hash": 6187315859872052756,
      "context_hash": 6092577738316519472,
      "translation": "테스트 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Crater",
      "source_hash": 13308220459473913358,
      "context_hash": 17503098966778988443,
      "translation": "Crater",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Crater is a tool which runs tests on many thousands of public projects.",
      "source_hash": 16164902777051790813,
      "context_hash": 6371782585978166237,
      "translation": "Crater는 수천 개의 공개 프로젝트에 대해 테스트를 실행하는 도구입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This tool has its own separate infrastructure for running, and is not run as part of CI.",
      "source_hash": 4833583047736462940,
      "context_hash": 1585272994219124137,
      "translation": "이 도구는 실행을 위한 별도의 자체 인프라를 갖추고 있으며, CI의 일부로 실행되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "See the [Crater chapter](crater.md) for more details.",
      "source_hash": 16936150398243361680,
      "context_hash": 3047957077214326663,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 [Crater 챕터](crater.md)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`cargotest`",
      "source_hash": 17640252931543231423,
      "context_hash": 8143608639906190118,
      "translation": "`cargotest`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`cargotest` is a small tool which runs `cargo test` on a few sample projects (such as `stylo`, `ripgrep`, `tokei`, etc.).",
      "source_hash": 12509158165711263610,
      "context_hash": 17224706955430777465,
      "translation": "`cargotest`는 몇 가지 샘플 프로젝트(예: `stylo`, `ripgrep`, `tokei` 등)에 대해 `cargo test`를 실행하는 작은 도구입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "This runs as part of CI and ensures there aren't any significant regressions:",
      "source_hash": 5492261143554865139,
      "context_hash": 80295879272022711,
      "translation": "이는 CI의 일부로 실행되며 중대한 회귀가 없는지 확인합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Large OSS Project builders",
      "source_hash": 16693138026886917025,
      "context_hash": 10783075549210809266,
      "translation": "대규모 OSS 프로젝트 빌더",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "We have CI jobs that build large open-source Rust projects that are used as regression tests in CI.",
      "source_hash": 14928660061350968556,
      "context_hash": 14137684686466871091,
      "translation": "저희는 CI에서 회귀 테스트로 사용되는 대규모 오픈소스 Rust 프로젝트를 빌드하는 CI 작업을 갖추고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:08:16.094719Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Our integration jobs build the following projects:",
      "source_hash": 6222439181471388955,
      "context_hash": 10522597578134815293,
      "translation": "저희의 통합 작업은 다음 프로젝트들을 빌드합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
